This software was generated by an autonomous software build from a short product brief. The checks that ran before each release (its own tests, an end-to-end walk of every documented flow, a security review and an operational readiness review) are published with the release as `clinicbook-0.1.0-checks.tar.gz`; read them before you rely on it.

